            "title": "Chinese stocks fall on tariff threats, rare earth companies surge",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks today's top moving stocks and biggest market stories in this Market Minute, including Chinese stock reactions from Alibaba (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BABA\">BABA</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/9988.HK\">9988.HK</a>), Baidu (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BIDU\">BIDU</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/9888.HK\">9888.HK</a>), and JD.com (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/JD\">JD</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/9618.HK\">9618.HK</a>) after President Trump<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/us-stocks-spin-trump-threatens-155927334.html\"> threatened tariff hikes against China</a>; chip stocks Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>), Broadcom (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AVGO\">AVGO</a>), and Advanced Micro Devices (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMD\">AMD</a>) falling on suggestions to AI chip export controls; and rare earth companies MP Materials (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:12;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MP\">MP</a>) and USA Rare Earth (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:13;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/USAR\">USAR</a>) are soaring.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:14;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
